Package: geowarden
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Thomas Marx <103289949+tommx0@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: bash, nftables, curl, whiptail, python3, gzip, iproute2, systemd
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Description: country allowlist for incoming connections via nftables
 Accepts new connections on the public interfaces only from selected
 countries. Country data comes from the DB-IP Lite geolocation database and
 is refreshed daily by a systemd timer. Established connections, VPN
 interfaces and open ports are exempt.
 .
 Managed with the menu tool "geowarden": turn blocking on/off, choose
 countries by continent and view allowed and blocked requests on a world
 map and in top 10 lists.
